      d="M526 155 0 250v34l587-123Zm158 1L146 330h160l428-169Zm115 4L532 330h130l181-172Zm113-4 2 174h133L952 154Zm103-10 218 184h169l-349-189Zm92-8 333 85v-24l-304-66Z"
